- Messages and folders in the tree layout have stable IDs. VSCode keeps a node collapsed across refreshes after you collapse it.
- Block labels in the view use 0-based `#N`, as you asked. Guided review labels still use 1-based `block #N`. I can switch the review to 0-based too if you want them to match.


